{
  "summary": "A single-modality RNA-only setup using PCA_n2000 was tested on singleprofile data, achieving validation accuracy of 0.4849 and F1 of 0.4639. This suggests baseline performance for RNA-only models, but its comparison to the multimodal configuration (0.5266 accuracy) indicates potential benefits from multimodal integration. The relative effectiveness of modality combination remains uncertain without direct comparative benchmarks."
}

